#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:337
msgid ""
"This button opens a dialog to allow the user to define a hyperlink either "
"internally within the spreadsheet or to an external resource such as a web "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Knappen öppnar en dialogruta där du kan skapa en hyperlänk antingen inom "
"kalkylbladet eller till en extern resurs, till exempel en webbsida."

